            "name": "affected",
            "namespace": "http://oval.mitre.org/XMLSchema/oval-definitions-5"
          },
          {
            "name": "description",
            "namespace": "http://oval.mitre.org/XMLSchema/oval-definitions-5",
            "text": "The \"/etc/group-\" file is a backup file of \"/etc/group\", and as such, contains information regarding groups that are configured on the system. Protection of this file is important for system security."
          }
        ],
